These stores deal in items of daily use like groceries,
confectionery, stationery, soft drinks, etc.
They have a large variety in each line of product.
They provide free home delivery, credit facility and other
services to their regular customers.
They create personal relationship with the customers
and keep them happy and satisfied.
General stores located in posh areas also keep popular
